### LedgerCore Phase 4 HTTP API Examples

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1

### 1. Register a New Customer
# @name registerCustomer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice.wonderland@example.com",
  "password": "CorrectHorseBatteryStaple123!"
}

### 2. Login as Customer (Obtain JWT)
# @name loginCustomer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice.wonderland@example.com",
  "password": "CorrectHorseBatteryStaple123!"
}

@customerToken = {{loginCustomer.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3. Login as Admin (Obtain Admin JWT)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@ledgercore.local",
  "password": "admin-initial-password-change-me"
}

@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. Open Account for Authenticated Customer
# @name openAccount
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currency": "USD",
  "initialDepositMinor": 0
}

@accountId = {{openAccount.response.body.id}}

### 5. List Caller's Accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 6. Get Account Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 7. Deposit Funds (Admin Only by Default)
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/deposits
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: DEP-{{$guid}}

{
  "amountMinor": 500000
}

### 8. Transfer Funds
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: TX-{{$guid}}

{
  "fromAccountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "toAccountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "amountMinor": 2500,
  "currency": "USD"
}

### 9. Account Statement
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/entries?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 10. Ledger Reconciliation (Admin Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reconciliation
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
